3. PREMIUM TIER
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Premium Features require a valid License Key. Subject to Your payment of the
applicable fees, the Licensor grants You a non-exclusive, non-transferable
license to use the Premium Features in Applications served from the hostnames
recorded in Your License Key, for the term ending on that key's expiry date.

3.1  A License Key is confidential to You. You may embed it in Applications You
     control, which necessarily exposes it to end users of those Applications;
     that exposure is expected and permitted. You may not publish, sell, share,
     or otherwise distribute a License Key for use by anyone else.

3.2  On expiry, the Software reverts to the Free Tier. Applications continue to
     function; only Premium Features become unavailable.

3.3  The Licensor may revoke a License Key that has been distributed in breach
     of Section 3.1, or obtained by fraud, in a subsequent release of the
     Software.

